<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>seem</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">&amp;SCENE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2KYb2aB7GzO4q1coNlUIPY</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.184" end="00:07.161">I'm speaking the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.161" end="00:10.340">I told you my all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.340" end="00:15.499">It may seem like I wasn't at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.499" end="00:19.764">이런나도 내가 싫은대</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.764" end="00:26.451">넌 어떻겠니</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.451" end="00:28.249">You told me your all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.249" end="00:31.549">Showing me love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.549" end="00:36.709">I know that you’ve tried all that you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.709" end="00:40.808">Wish this was a lie, but knowing its not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.808" end="00:46.356">It's hurting me dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.356" end="00:48.450">The way that you touched</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.450" end="00:51.144">The way that it felt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.144" end="00:56.278">I'll never forget the words that you left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.278" end="00:58.974">The way that you cared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.974" end="01:02.023">The ways that you helped</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.023" end="01:07.163">I'll never find someone like you ever again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.163" end="01:09.609">Cause nothing compares</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.609" end="01:12.182">To the way that you smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.182" end="01:16.182">And knowing that I'll never get to see it again</p></div></body></tt>